    {
      "id": "setup",
      "title": {"en_us": "Choose a Distributor and Connect ME", "zh_cn": "分发器选型与 ME 接入"},
      "basePlateSize": 7,
      "viewScale": 0.75,
      "steps": [
        {"type": "encapsulate_bounds", "bounds": [7, 5, 7]},
        {"type": "set_block", "block": "createpackage:package_distributor", "blockPos": [1, 1, 2]},
        {"type": "set_block", "block": "ae2:pattern_provider", "blockPos": [1, 1, 1]},
        {"type": "set_block", "block": "ae2:controller", "blockPos": [0, 1, 1]},
        {"type": "set_block", "block": "createpackage:basic_package_distributor", "blockPos": [4, 1, 2]},
        {"type": "set_block", "block": "ae2:controller", "blockPos": [4, 1, 1]},
        {"type": "set_block", "block": "createpackage:advanced_package_distributor", "blockPos": [6, 1, 2]},
        {"type": "set_block", "block": "ae2:controller", "blockPos": [6, 1, 1]},
        {"type": "show_section", "direction": "down", "blockPos": [0, 1, 0], "blockPos2": [6, 2, 2]},
        {"type": "idle", "duration": 15},
        {"type": "show_controls", "action": "right", "point": [1.5, 2.1, 1.5], "direction": "down", "duration": 45},
        {"type": "highlight_section", "blockPos": [1, 1, 1], "blockPos2": [1, 1, 2], "color": "white", "duration": 110},
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 105,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "color": "blue",
          "point": [
            1.5,
            2.4,
            2.5
          ],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "The normal Distributor needs an adjacent AE2 Pattern Provider. Open that provider GUI and put the processing patterns there. Link the assembly route to the distributor itself.",
            "zh_cn": "普通分发器需要相邻的 AE2 样板供应器。打开供应器界面放入处理样板，装配路线则链接到分发器本体。"
          }
        },
        {"type": "idle", "duration": 110},
        {"type": "show_controls", "action": "right", "point": [4.5, 2.5, 2.5], "direction": "down", "duration": 45},
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 105,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "color": "blue",
          "point": [
            4.5,
            2.5,
            2.5
          ],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "The Basic Distributor contains its own provider with 9 pattern slots. Open its GUI empty-handed. It stores one ordered route and runs one job at a time.",
            "zh_cn": "基础分发器内置供应逻辑与 9 个样板槽，空手右键打开界面。它保存一条有序路线，同时运行一个作业。"
          }
        },
        {"type": "idle", "duration": 110},
        {"type": "show_controls", "action": "right", "point": [6.5, 2.5, 2.5], "direction": "down", "duration": 45},
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 105,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "color": "blue",
          "point": [
            6.5,
            2.5,
            2.5
          ],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "The Advanced Distributor has 36 pattern slots. Each Mechanical Package Pattern stores its own route, so one distributor can serve several independent assembly lines.",
            "zh_cn": "高级分发器有 36 个样板槽。每张机械封包样板携带自己的路线，因此一台分发器可以管理多条独立装配线。"
          }
        },
        {"type": "idle", "duration": 110},
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 115,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "color": "white",
          "point": [
            4.5,
            1.5,
            1.5
          ],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Controllers here mark ME connections only. A working build needs AE power, available channels, storage containing the materials and a crafting CPU. This is not a complete ME network simulation.",
            "zh_cn": "这里的控制器只表示 ME 连接。实际搭建还需 AE 电力、可用频道、存有材料的存储和合成 CPU；本场景未模拟完整 ME 网络。"
          }
        },
        {"type": "idle", "duration": 120},
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 115,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "color": "white",
          "point": [
            4.5,
            2.5,
            2.5
          ],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Distributors supply ingredients and recover outputs for a real Create line. They do not make physical parcels, move items between stations or provide rotation. Kinetic Pattern Providers serve individual machines instead.",
            "zh_cn": "分发器为真实流水线投料并回收产物，不生成实体物流包裹，也不负责工位间搬运或提供转速。动力样板供应器则面向单台加工机器。"
          }
        },
        {"type": "idle", "duration": 120}
      ]
    },
